      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">1-D DP</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Strings</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/decode-ways/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 91</a></div>\n  <h1>Decode Ways</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: the last letter of any decoding uses either the last digit or the last two digits, so ways(i) = ways(i-1) if the last digit is 1..9, plus ways(i-2) if the last two digits are 10..26. Climbing Stairs with two gates; O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
